# Accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA)

Implement in `hallowed-ground.css`, Blade, and JS. Tokens stay slate + gold + parchment. Do **not** introduce purple/indigo SaaS defaults or flat cream-serif clichés.

## A. Color and contrast

**Contrast 4.5:1.** Body text MUST be at least 4.5:1 against its background. Large text / bold UI (≥18px or ≥14px bold) may use 3:1.

Hallowed Ground floors (do not go lighter on dark UI):

| Role | Token | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Body on dark | parchment / `--color-ink` on slate | Default marketing chrome |
| Secondary | `--color-ink-soft` `#d5ccbb` | Prefer for paragraphs |
| Muted labels / mono | slate-400 `#9bb4c9` | Lightest allowed on dark surfaces |
| On gold buttons | `--color-on-gold` `#14100a` | Never parchment on gold-500 without checking |

Gold `#e0be72` is for accents/buttons, not long body copy on parchment-light panels without contrast checks.

**Color independence.** Errors, validation, and status MUST not rely on color alone. Pair color with an icon **and** text.

## B. Keyboard and touch

**Focus-visible rings.** NEVER `outline: none` without a replacement ring. Prefer gold focus:

```css
:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--gold-500);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}
```

**44×44 touch targets.** Every button, nav item, and form control MUST have a minimum tap area of 44×44 CSS pixels on mobile.

**Semantics over divs.** On-page actions → `<button type="button">`. URL changes → `<a href>`. Forbidden: click-only `<div>` / `<span>`.

## C. Motion

Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Compass spin and reveal animations must zero out under the query. No uncancellable JS timers for decoration.

## Do not

- Use indigo focus rings or purple gradient themes
- `outline-none` with no ring
- Color-only errors
- Div-as-button
